001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.    TCAPVAL.
001300 AUTHOR.        BARBARA WINTER.
001400*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR.
001500*DATE-WRITTEN.  AUGUST 1989.
001600*DATE-COMPILED.
001700*REMARKS.
001800*
001900*D   PROGRAM TO ENTER CAPABILITY VALUE FOR STOREROOM INVENTORIES.
002000*************************************************************
      *C   07SEP1995  DAVE PLUM
      *C     REVISED CODE TO TREAT F3 AS THE EXIT KEY FOR THE PROGRAM.
      *C     A BUG HAS APPARENTLY EXISTED WITH THIS PROGRAM SINCE IT
      *C     WAS CONVERTED FROM THE HP-3000.  ONCE A USER WENT INTO THE
      *C     PROGRAM THERE WAS NO WAY OUT.  THE FIRST SCREEN INDICATED
      *C     "F3-EXIT", BUT F3 TOOK THE USER TO THE 2ND SCREEN.  THE
      *C     2ND SCREEN ALSO INDICATED "F3-EXIT", BUT THIS TOOK THE
      *C     USER BACK TO THE FIRST SCREEN.  IT IS LIKELY THAT THIS
      *C     PROGRAM IS NOT BEING USED, OR WE SHOULD HAVE RECEIVED
      *C     COMPLAINTS BEFORE NOW.  THE PROBLEM WAS BROUGHT TO OUR
      *C     ATTENTION BY A PROGRAMMER WHO WAS REVIEWING WHAT SOME
      *C     OF THE CSIS/MMIS MENU OPTIONS LOOKED LIKE.
      *C
      *C     SPECIAL NOTE: THIS PROGRAM ALWAYS TREATS F5 AND F6 THE
      *C                   SAME AS IF THE USER HAD PRESSED THE ENTER
      *C                   KEY.  THIS SEEMS TO BE A CONSEQUENCE OF
      *C                   THE "DISPCAL2" COPYLIB MEMBER.
002100*************************************************************
002200
002300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
002600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
002900
003000 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
003100 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-O
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZCAPVAL-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

003300
003400 DATA DIVISION.
003500 FILE SECTION.
      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  MPLTINFO-PK-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-PK-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC        PIC X(1500).

      *------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
003600
004000
004100 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004200************************************************************
004300*            W O R K I N G   S T O R A G E                 *
004400************************************************************
004500 01  X                         PIC S9(4) BINARY VALUE ZERO.
004600*----------  FLAG TO CALL ROUTINE FOR FULL DATASETS
004700 01  CALL-DFULL                PIC X        VALUE "N".
004800
004900**************************************************************
005000*                 C A L L E D  R O U T I N E S               *
005100**************************************************************
005200 COPY TSHWRDFM   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDAT2   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD    IN COPYLIB.
005300*---------- VSETERROR AND VPUTWINDOW
005400 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER            PIC X(76)    VALUE SPACES.
005500 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER-RD REDEFINES MESSAGE-BUFFER.
005600     05  MSG-BUFFER.
               10  MESSAGE-BUFFER-1  PIC X(1).
               10  FILLER            PIC X(67).
005700     05  MSG-VALUE             PIC X(8).
005800 01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 76    BINARY.
005900 01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 0     BINARY.
006000 01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1     BINARY.
006100
006200*---------- VPRINTFORM
006300 01  SCREEN-PRINT-PARMS.
006400     05  PRINT-CTL             PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1     BINARY.
006500     05  PAGE-CTL              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 49    BINARY.
006600     05  SPOOL-FIL-OPEN-SW     PIC X        VALUE "Y".
006700
006800 COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.
006900**************************************************************
007000*                    D A T A  B A S E                        *
007100**************************************************************
007200
007300 01  MPLTINFO                  PIC X(16)    VALUE "MPLTINFO;".
007400 01  PLT-ARG.
007500     05  ARG1                  PIC X        VALUE "W".
007600     05  ARG2                  PIC X(3)     VALUE SPACES.
007700
007800 01  ALL-ITEM-LIST                 PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
       01  DSET-NAME                     PIC X(16).
007900 COPY DATAB  IN COPYLIB.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
008000 COPY MPLT0    IN COPYLIB.
008100 COPY MPLTCLIN IN COPYLIB.
008200 COPY VCOMAREA IN COPYLIB.
008300
008400 01  FORMFILE.
008500     05  FORM-FNAME                PIC X(7)  VALUE "FCAPVAL".
008600     05  FILLER                    PIC X     VALUE ".".
008700     05  FORM-GNAME.
008800         10  FORM-GNAME1           PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
008900         10  FORM-GNAME2           PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
009000     05  FILLER                    PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.
009100
009200**********************************************************
009300*               S C R E E N   B U F F E R                *
009400**********************************************************
009500 01  DE-FIELDS.
009600     05  SCR-LINE             PIC 9(2).
009700     05  SCR-GRP-DESC         PIC X(30).
009800     05  SCR-VALUE            PIC ZZZZZZZZZ9.
           05  SCR-VALUE-9 REDEFINES SCR-VALUE
                                    PIC 9(10).
009900     05  SCR-TYPE             PIC X.
010000     05  SCR-CLASS-AREA.
010100         07  SCR-CLASS OCCURS 20 TIMES  PIC X(3).
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE      PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE      PIC X(79).

010200******************************************************
010300*   MISCELLANEOUS DATA TO PASS TO SUBPROGRAMS        *
010400******************************************************
010500 COPY LANGUAGE IN COPYLIB.
010600 COPY ESCNAM2  IN COPYLIB.
010700
010800**************************************************************
010900*                                                            *
011000*        P R O C E D U R E        D I V I S I O N            *
011100*                                                            *
011200**************************************************************
011300 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
011400 00-CONTROL SECTION 00.
011500 00-RCVEXEC-MAIN.
011600     PERFORM 9999-OPEN-STUFF.
011800     PERFORM 200-SCREEN THRU 299-EXIT.
012000     PERFORM 9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
012200     GOBACK.

041100 2100-BLOWUP.
041200     MOVE "TCAPVAL" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
041210     MOVE FORMFILE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
           MOVE MPLTINFO-KEY TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3).
041300     MOVE VIEW-NFNAME TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
041400     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
041500           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
041600           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
041800
017600**********************************************************
017700  200-SCREEN.
017800     MOVE "FCAPVAL" TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           PERFORM 9951-GETNEXTFORM.
           PERFORM 9958-INITFORM.
019000     MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
019100     MOVE 76     TO MESSAGE-ACTLEN.
           MOVE ZERO TO SCR-LINE, SCR-VALUE.
           MOVE SPACES TO SCR-GRP-DESC, SCR-TYPE,
             SCR-CLASS-AREA, DE-COMMAND-LINE, DE-MESSAGE-LINE.
019300
019400 205-DISPLAY-SCREEN.
019500     MOVE 7 TO SRF-KEYSET.

       2051-SHOWFORM.
           PERFORM 9953-PUTBUFFER.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 9989-WS-X.
           IF MESSAGE-BUFFER-1 NOT = SPACES
               PERFORM 9954-SETERROR
               GO TO 2051-SHOWFORM.

      ***************************************************
      * 07SEP1995 - REPLACED THE FOLLOWING "IF" STATMENTS
020300*    IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 7
020400*       GO TO 200-SCREEN.
020500*    IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8
020600*       GO TO 299-EXIT.
      ***************************************************
020700
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 3
              GO TO 299-EXIT.

           PERFORM 9952-GETBUFFER.
021400
021500*----------  READ MPLTINFO SERIALLY AND FIND ALL CLASSES
021600*            FOR THIS REPROT LINE
           PERFORM 9999-INIT-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
022100
022200     MOVE SPACES TO SCR-CLASS-AREA.
022300     MOVE 1 TO X.
022400
022500 210-READ.
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET2-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
022800     IF END-OF-FILE
022900        GO TO 220-DISPLAY-SCREEN.

023300     IF MPLTINFO-PERCENT NOT = "W"
023400        GO TO 210-READ.
023500     IF MPLT-GROUP-NUMBER-9 NOT = SCR-LINE
023600        GO TO 210-READ.
023610     IF MPLT-MAT-TYPE NOT = SCR-TYPE
023620        GO TO 210-READ.
023700     MOVE MPLT-CLASS-DESC TO SCR-GRP-DESC.
023800     MOVE MPLT-CLASS-AREA TO SCR-CLASS (X).
023900     MOVE MPLT-MAT-TYPE TO SCR-TYPE.
024000     MOVE MPLT-VALUE TO SCR-VALUE.
024100     ADD 1 TO X.
024200     IF X < 21
024300        GO TO 210-READ.
024400
024500 220-DISPLAY-SCREEN.
025200     MOVE "FCAPVAL2" TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           PERFORM 9951-GETNEXTFORM.
           MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           PERFORM 9956-PUTWINDOW.
026100
026200     MOVE 8 TO SRF-KEYSET.
       221-SHOWFORM.
           PERFORM 9953-PUTBUFFER.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 9989-WS-X.
           IF MESSAGE-BUFFER-1 NOT = SPACES
               PERFORM 9954-SETERROR
               GO TO 221-SHOWFORM.

      ***************************************************
      * 07SEP1995 - REPLACED THE FOLLOWING "IF" STATMENTS
027000*    IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 7
027100*       GO TO 200-SCREEN.
027200*    IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
027300*       GO TO 299-EXIT.
      ***************************************************
027400
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 7
              GO TO 200-SCREEN.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 3
              GO TO 299-EXIT.

           PERFORM 9952-GETBUFFER.
028200*----------  READ AND DELETE ALL ENTRIES THAT WERE PUT ON THE
028300*            SCREEN AND THEN ADD THE ENTRIES THAT THE USER
028400*            ENTERED
028500     MOVE 1 TO X.
           PERFORM 9999-INIT-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
029000
029100 225-READ.
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET2-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
029400     IF END-OF-FILE
029500        GO TO 230-ADD-NEW-ENTRIES.

029900     IF MPLTINFO-PERCENT NOT = "W"
030000        GO TO 225-READ.
030100     IF MPLT-GROUP-NUMBER-9 NOT = SCR-LINE
030200        GO TO 225-READ.
030300
030310     IF MPLT-MAT-TYPE NOT = SCR-TYPE
030320        GO TO 225-READ.

           MOVE "MPLTINFO;" TO DSET-NAME.
           PERFORM 9930-LOCK.
           PERFORM 9999-DBDELETE-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
           PERFORM 9940-UNLOCK.
030800
031900     GO TO 225-READ.
032000
032100 230-ADD-NEW-ENTRIES.
032200     MOVE 1 TO X.
032300
032400 235-ADD-LOOP.
032500     IF SCR-CLASS (X) = SPACES
032600        ADD 1 TO X
032700        IF X < 21
032800           GO TO 235-ADD-LOOP
032900        ELSE
033000           GO TO 200-SCREEN.
033100
           MOVE "MPLTINFO;" TO DSET-NAME.
           PERFORM 9930-LOCK.
033600
033700     MOVE "W" TO MPLTINFO-PERCENT.
033800     MOVE SCR-CLASS (X) TO MPLT-CLASS-AREA.
033900     MOVE MPLTINFO-KEY TO PLT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-DBGET7-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
           IF GOOD-CALL
               PERFORM 9999-DBDELETE-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
034400
034500     MOVE PLT-ARG TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
034600     MOVE SCR-GRP-DESC TO MPLT-CLASS-DESC.
034700     MOVE SCR-TYPE TO MPLT-MAT-TYPE.
034800     MOVE SCR-LINE TO MPLT-GROUP-NUMBER-9.
034900     MOVE SCR-VALUE-9 TO MPLT-VALUE.
035000
           PERFORM 9999-DBPUT-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
           PERFORM 9940-UNLOCK.
036200
036300     ADD 1 TO X.
036400     IF X < 21
036500        GO TO 235-ADD-LOOP
036600     ELSE
036700        GO TO 200-SCREEN.
036800 299-EXIT.  EXIT.
043700
       COPY HCATREAD IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPCAL2 IN COPYLIB.

       9930-LOCK.
       9940-UNLOCK.
       9951-GETNEXTFORM.
       9952-GETBUFFER.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO DE-FIELDS.

       9953-PUTBUFFER.
           MOVE DE-FIELDS TO DISPLAY-REC.

       9954-SETERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (99).
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (FIELD-NUMBER).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE-MESSAGE-LINE.

       9955-CLEAR-FORM.
           MOVE SPACES TO DE-FIELDS, MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       9956-PUTWINDOW.
       9957-FIELDEDITS.
       9958-INITFORM.
       9959-SHOWFORM.
       9960-SETKEYLABEL.
       9961-AUTOREAD.
       9962-OPENFORM.
       9963-CLOSEFORM.
       9964-FINISHFORM.

       9999-DBGET2-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ MPLTINFO-PK-O NEXT INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "1" OR FILE-STATUS = "46"
               MOVE 11 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBGET2 ERR 9999-DBGET2-MPLTINFO-PK-O"
                   TO BU-MSG-AREA
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-INIT-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
           MOVE SPACES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-PK-REC-O.
           START MPLTINFO-PK-O KEY >= PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-PK-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-DBDELETE-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           DELETE MPLTINFO-PK-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBDELETE ERR 9999-DBDELETE-MPLTINFO-PK-O"
                   TO BU-MSG-AREA
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-DBGET7-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-PK-REC-O.
           READ MPLTINFO-PK-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBGET7 ERR 9999-DBGET7-MPLTINFO-PK-O"
                   TO BU-MSG-AREA
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-RESET-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-PK-REC-O.
           START MPLTINFO-PK-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-PK-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

       9999-DBPUT-MPLTINFO-PK-O.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-PK-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERR 9999-DBPUT-MPLTINFO-PK-O"
                   TO BU-MSG-AREA
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-OPEN-STUFF.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.
           OPEN I-O   MPLTINFO-PK-O                              .

       9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.
           CLOSE      MPLTINFO-PK-O                              .
